# 📊 MarketHub — Live Market Terminal + Demand/Supply Zone Screener

A **Streamlit** app that puts a compact, live **4-row global market board** on top and
the backtested **Demand/Supply Zone scanner** below, plus **live news** and **NSE
futures-stock events** — all keyless (no API keys).

![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/streamlit-1.63-blue) ![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.13-green)

---

## 🌍 The Live Market Board (top — 4 rows)

| Row | Instruments |
|---|---|
| 💵 **Currencies** | **DXY** (US Dollar Index) · **USDINR** (USD/Indian Rupee) |
| 🏛️ **Rates & Bonds** | **TLT** (iShares 20+ Yr Treasury) · **US 10Y** (10-Yr Yield) |
| 🥇 **Metals & Energy** | **XAUUSD** (Gold Spot) · **XAGUSD** (Silver Spot) · **SPOTCRUDE** (WTI Crude Cash) |
| 📈 **Global Indices** | **GIFT NIFTY** (50 Index Future) · **NIFTY 50** · **US30** (Dow) · **US500** (S&P 500) · **JP225** (Nikkei) · **SSE** (China Composite) |

Each tile shows symbol · name · **live price** · **Δ%**, colored green/red, and the source
(`Y` = Yahoo Finance, `TV` = TradingView). The board auto-refreshes every 45s.

### 🧱 Live Sector Indices (just below the board)

A compact strip of **12 live NSE sectoral indices** (from NSE `allIndices`) so you can
see **sector rotation at a glance** — Auto, IT, Pharma, FMCG, Metal, Energy, Realty,
Media, PSU Bank, FinServ, Bank, NIFTY 50 — each with live price and daily Δ% (green/red).
Auto-refreshes every 60s.

---

## 🧭 Zone Scan — All NSE Futures Stocks (every timeframe)

Turn on **"Scan ALL NSE futures stocks (both TFs)"** in the sidebar to scan **all 18
NSE F&O stocks across BOTH 2h AND 4h** and see **every VALID zone** in one table:

- Columns: Symbol · TF · Pattern · Direction · **Score** · Entry · SL · TP · State ·
  Touch count · **option-chain link**
- Filters: **State** (Active only / All zones), **Direction** (Demand / Supply),
  **Sort** (Score ↓ / Distance / Symbol)
- ⭐ marks **HQ zones** (score ≥ 90). Rows are one zone each — the real universe scan.

## 🎯 The Zone Screener (bottom)

Runs the tuned, backtest-verified `zone_core` (v10.1) engine on live 2H/4H data:

- **RAW OHLCV → pattern detection → core validation → VALID/INVALID → 100-pt scoring**
- Sidebar controls: symbol, timeframe (2h/4h), min score, look-back, spec-strict rules,
  and the **Recommended setup** toggle.
- **Recommended setup** = `DBD pattern · MID entry · fixed target · 0.5×ATR SL buffer · RR 1:3`,
  which gave the best realistic after-charge ROI:
  - `24-month  +13.01%`  (34 trades, win 41%)
  - `6-month   +10.88%`  (8 trades, win 62%)
- Also shows a forward **MFE / win@kR** quality strip (`@1R/@2R/@5R`, tested %).

---

## 🏛️ FII / DII Flows (today live + last 3 days)

- **Today's card** — FII/FPI & DII **net (₹ Cr)** and buy/sell values in real time
  (NSE), plus the NIFTY close.
- **Last 3 days** — tap each previous day (to expand) to see that day's FII/DII net
  and NIFTY close. Source: niftytrader daily series + NSE live. A monthly summary is
  available as a bonus.

## 🎯 Options OI — Put / Call chains + links

For the selected symbol, this panel shows:
- **Live OI** (best-effort from NSE): total **Call OI**, **Put OI**, **Put-Call Ratio**,
  ATM strike, and max OI strikes + a compact strike table. *Note: NSE rate-limits the
  option-chain JSON for cloud/datacenter IPs, so live OI may be unavailable on Streamlit
  Cloud — the links below always work in your browser.*
- **Deep links** (always available) to view the live Put/Call OI chain:
  `NSE Option Chain`, `niftytrader.in` (live), `Sensibull`/`Kotak Neo`/`ICICI Direct`.
  Works for indices (`^NSEI` → NIFTY, `^NSEBANK` → BANKNIFTY) and F&O stocks.

## 📰 Live News & ⚡ NSE Future Events (touch = read full)

- **Live News** — Moneycontrol, Economic Times, Business Standard, Reuters, Investing.
  Headlines are auto-tagged (`NIFTY`, `USDINR`, `GOLD`, `OIL`, `FED`, `RBI`, …).
  **Tap any headline** → the full article is fetched and shown **in-page** (with an
  "open original" link).
- **NSE Futures Events** — company/announcement headlines filtered to the tracked NSE
  F&O set (Reliance, TCS, Infosys, HDFC Bank, ICICI, SBI, Airtel, ITC, L&T, Titan, …)
  and generic F&O events (expiry, circuit, block deal, bonus/split, results…). Tap to
